vars:pre-request {
  baseURL: http://127.0.0.1:8800/oauth2/v1
}

docs {
  # basicauth Test Bruno
  
  This is the collection of Bruno tests for the authorization server. There
  are calls for the various endpoints and include some for error responses.
  
  ## TokenReq - Request a Token (presumed successful)
  
  This is a request for an Oauth2 token that should succeed if using the default
  mappings. 
  
  ## NoGrant
  
  ## BadGrantType
  
  ## GetJWKS
  
  This is a request for the authorization server's public key. The EC key is
  returned in JWKS format. See [RFC 7517](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7517)
  
